    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lacca</span></b> , ae, f.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A swelling on the shinbone of draught-cattle</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 1, 27, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3,
				18</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A plant</i>, otherwise unknown,
				<i><span class="en">App. Herb. 3 <i>fin.</i></span></i></div>
